ah, the granary half an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0036\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please log that I saw Truman, the colleague one, today? I visited him this afternoon.\", \"I try to keep track of who I've seen lately, and today it was Truman, my colleague, so please note that I visited him today.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0037\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out where everyone stands money-wise before the next dinner, so what's Eleni Delmere's balance with me in the lothock pot group?\", \"Right, and what about Shethara?\", \"Totally different thing, I can't remember when I'm meant to be heading out, so what time is the ottoman club?\", \"And while I'm planning around it, what else have I got on that day?\"], [\"whats eleni delmere's balance w me in lothock pot\", \"and shethara?\", \"what time's the ottoman club\", \"anything else on that day?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0038\", \"v\": [[\"Everyone's been nagging me about the money from the holiday and I'd rather just get it done, so can you square up with all the Bellagio trip people who owe me?\"], [\"pls settle up w everyone on the Bellagio trip who still owes me\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0039\", \"v\": [[\"I was working on something a while back and now I can't find it anywhere, where did my ottoman draft go?\", \"Different thing, I've been cleaning up the shared costs and one of them shouldn't be there, so can you bin the night expense?\", \"Oh no, I didn't actually mean to do that, sorry, can you bring it back?\", \"Also, I've got something lothock-related coming up but I can't remember the details, so when is my lothock thing?\"], [\"Could you tell me where my ottoman draft has gone, please?\", \"Separately, would you mind deleting the night expense?\", \"I'm sorry, I didn't mean that. Could you restore it, please?\", \"Could you also tell me when my lothock thing is?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0040\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when my potter thing is, please?\", \"On a different note, could you show me my notes about tortoise?\", \"Is that in my tasks as well, please?\", \"Could you tell me whether anyone owes me cash?\", \"Would you have a photo of either of them, by any chance?\"], [\"when's the potter thing?\", \"tortoise notes\", \"in my tasks too?\", \"anyone owe me cash?\", \"photos of any of them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0041\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what potter things I have, please?\"], [\"potter stuff?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0042\", \"v\": [[\"umm how much did I… what did I pay for the bellagio top-up?\"], [\"I'm going through my spending from the holiday and one bit's bugging me, so what did I end up paying for the bellagio top-up?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0043\", \"v\": [[\"Finally got round to it this morning after putting it off for ages, so you can mark the ask radek job as done.\", \"Separately, I'm trying to work out how busy I'll be, so how many events have I got next week?\"], [\"ok so I've… yeah I finished the ask radek job, you can tick that off\", \"oh and um, how many events have I got next week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0045\", \"v\": [[\"opening hours for tomorrow online?\", \"December pics?\", \"who's in the Vearie one?\", \"phoned the second one, log it\", \"no, wrong one — the second one\"], [\"can u look up opening hours online for tomorrow\", \"what pics did i take in December\", \"the Vearie one, whos in it?\", \"i phoned the second one, log that pls\", \"no wait wrong one, i meant the second one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0046\", \"v\": [[\"Something I don't want to forget for when her birthday comes around — can you jot down a note that says Maelle likes the clover?\", \"Also, I think we'll be a bit late leaving, so could you move the postuton trip fifteen minutes later?\"], [\"note: Maelle likes the clover\", \"postuton trip fifteen minutes later\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0047\", \"v\": [[\"visited Truman, log it\", \"the beekeeper\"], [\"umm so I visited Truman today, can you… can you log that?\", \"oh uh the beekeeper one, that Truman\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0048\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please pull up the house wifi entry in my locker? Just the entry, not the password.\", \"Also, would you mind deleting all of my ask tasks?\"], [\"show me the house wifi entry in the locker\", \"also delete all my ask tasks pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0049\", \"v\": [[\"A friend's staying over and wants to get online, and I've completely forgotten it, so what's the actual password for the house wifi?\"], [\"Could you tell me the actual password for the house wifi, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w05-0050\", \"v\": [[\"how much has been spent in the Bellagio group\", \"where was the boat one taken\", \"whos invited to the tortoise viewing\", \"got their contact details?\", \"also note down gift ideas for Crevir pls\"], [\"Bellagio group spend?\", \"boat one, taken where?\", \"tortoise viewing invitees?\", \"their contact details\", \"note: gift ideas for Crevir\"]]}","ttft_ms":9898,"type":"result","duration_ms":26547,"uuid":"171e5dfd-0f7c-42a2-a238-2ee35571f963","ttft_stream_ms":1403,"time_to_request_ms":181,"first_content_frame_ms":1403,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21882598,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278433180.225,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
